WEBVTT

00:00.270 --> 00:10.400
Under the moon’s curse, inside of a cold dream…

00:18.910 --> 00:25.290
Kotoba no nai sekai de bokura wa ai wo kataru

00:18.910 --> 00:25.290
In a world without words, we speak of love

00:25.290 --> 00:29.250
itsuka kimi ni todoku made

00:25.290 --> 00:29.250
until it reaches you someday.

00:32.090 --> 00:38.970
Kizu darake no kaina de dakiyoseta kuchibiru no

00:32.090 --> 00:38.970
I want to melt the frozen over wish...

00:38.970 --> 00:44.640
haritsumeta negai tokashitakute

00:38.970 --> 00:44.640
from the lips that I embraced with arms covered in wounds.

00:44.890 --> 00:51.610
Nee, aishiatta kako no utsukushisa sutesareba

00:44.890 --> 00:51.610
Hey, if I abandon the beauty of the past when we loved each other,

00:51.990 --> 00:57.780
ashita motto kirei na yoru e yukeru kara

00:51.990 --> 00:57.780
then tomorrow, I can go to a more beautiful night.

00:58.160 --> 01:06.330
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka kara

00:58.160 --> 01:06.330
Under the moon’s curse, from inside of a cold dream.

01:06.330 --> 01:13.010
Kimi wo tooku tsuresaritakute

01:06.330 --> 01:13.010
I want to take you somewhere far away,

01:13.010 --> 01:16.430
doko made yukeru

01:13.010 --> 01:16.430
and go anywhere,

01:16.430 --> 01:24.020
ai wo shinjite ii basho made

01:16.430 --> 01:24.020
to a place where we can believe in love.

01:30.500 --> 01:35.070
Seimei, you were the
only one I talked to...

01:35.470 --> 01:37.570
Ritsuka, morning!

01:39.200 --> 01:42.230
Yuiko! Good morning!

01:42.230 --> 01:44.200
You're pretty today, as usual.

01:44.200 --> 01:45.330
But now...

01:45.880 --> 01:47.710
Yayoi, morning!

01:47.710 --> 01:48.670
Good morning!

01:48.670 --> 01:50.210
Oh, good morning!

01:51.890 --> 01:53.240
I like Yuiko.

01:53.970 --> 01:55.910
I like Miss Shinonome.

01:56.390 --> 01:57.930
I like Yayoi.

01:59.680 --> 02:00.900
Even those guys...

02:00.900 --> 02:02.750
Did you watch that yesterday?

02:02.750 --> 02:05.220
Yes! It was so interesting.

02:02.810 --> 02:04.270
I like these people as well.

02:05.400 --> 02:08.200
Hey, let's play dodgeball!

02:08.200 --> 02:09.100
Yeah!

02:09.400 --> 02:10.690
Me too!

02:10.690 --> 02:11.950
Hurry, hurry!

02:12.520 --> 02:15.880
When I met people before, liking them
was the furthest thing from my mind...

02:20.120 --> 02:27.010
Seimei... Perhaps, life
shouldn't be thrown away.

02:27.010 --> 02:28.460
Ritsuka!

02:30.920 --> 02:32.670
Let's go to Yayoi's place today.

02:32.670 --> 02:33.230
Huh?

02:33.650 --> 02:36.680
Yesterday, I bought a
lot of games at Akiba.

02:36.680 --> 02:38.380
Okay? Let's go, let's go!

02:38.610 --> 02:39.950
B-But...

02:39.950 --> 02:42.060
You don't have to come
if you don't want to.

02:42.060 --> 02:45.350
Instead, I'll be alone with Yuiko.

02:45.490 --> 02:46.310
I'll go!

02:46.310 --> 02:48.160
Really? All right!

02:48.160 --> 02:49.600
Isn't that great, Yayoi?

02:50.190 --> 02:50.710
Man!

02:51.550 --> 02:55.000
Me, being invited to someone's home...

02:56.240 --> 02:59.240
I don't want to forget today.

03:10.250 --> 03:12.650
No way, no way, there's
no way I can do this!

03:12.650 --> 03:13.130
Huh?

03:13.960 --> 03:14.870
Thanks for waiting.

03:15.520 --> 03:16.490
Cake!

03:16.970 --> 03:17.880
Looks yummy!

03:18.160 --> 03:20.390
Yuiko, you like strawberries, right?

03:20.390 --> 03:23.170
I love them.
Is this Takashimaya's cake?

03:23.170 --> 03:25.580
Hey, I'm gonna reset this.

03:25.580 --> 03:27.130
Oh, uh-huh, sure.

03:27.130 --> 03:28.890
Yuiko, you really know, don't you?

03:27.350 --> 03:28.520
Geez...

03:34.360 --> 03:35.190
This...

03:37.440 --> 03:38.230
It's similar...

03:38.730 --> 03:42.850
Aoyagi, you better come quick
or Yuiko will eat the whole thing.

03:42.850 --> 03:43.930
How rude!

03:43.930 --> 03:45.070
Yayoi, what's this?

03:47.000 --> 03:48.770
A rendezvous point,
for this internet game...

03:54.590 --> 03:56.670
My brother played
games over the internet!

03:57.450 --> 04:03.220
World 98, North 74, Floor A11, at 12*05!

04:04.200 --> 04:07.470
Somebody's there! Somebody's waiting!

04:09.310 --> 04:10.580
What's this?

04:10.580 --> 04:11.850
Soubi...

04:16.680 --> 04:17.410
This is it.

04:20.110 --> 04:21.900
Please enter your username.

04:20.110 --> 04:21.900
Cancel

04:22.250 --> 04:23.150
Name?

04:24.080 --> 04:25.350
"Ritsuka" will do.

04:25.950 --> 04:28.080
Someone's already logged on with that name.
Please use another.

04:27.440 --> 04:28.080
Huh?

04:29.120 --> 04:30.480
Let's try "Aoyagi".

04:31.900 --> 04:33.040
No good, either.

04:33.330 --> 04:36.130
Ritsuka, dinner! Hurry down!

04:36.520 --> 04:39.710
I'm studying! I'll eat later!

04:39.800 --> 04:40.520
What?

04:41.640 --> 04:45.380
Sorry Mother, but this is for Seimei.

04:46.820 --> 04:50.480
I made all Ritsuka's favorite dishes!

04:59.570 --> 05:01.720
Are there so many similar names?

05:06.720 --> 05:10.870
Ritsuka's real name is
Loveless, one without love.

05:17.750 --> 05:21.550
Please enter your name.

05:17.750 --> 05:21.550
Cancel

05:21.550 --> 05:21.590
Are you really Loveless?

05:25.190 --> 05:26.960
What's this question?

05:27.350 --> 05:28.730
Kinda creepy...

05:31.390 --> 05:31.930
No!

05:32.300 --> 05:33.470
It's not Ritsuka!

05:33.630 --> 05:35.430
That child isn't Ritsuka!

05:41.280 --> 05:42.140
It's starting!

05:47.930 --> 05:49.660
I don't need to rely on Soubi!

05:54.190 --> 05:55.080
That's odd.

05:55.280 --> 05:57.560
Is it Ritsuka Aoyagi again?

05:57.560 --> 05:59.290
I can't reach him no
matter how much I try.

05:59.540 --> 06:00.170
What?

06:00.930 --> 06:02.230
I see...

06:02.600 --> 06:04.380
Soubi, you've been dumped!

06:08.530 --> 06:09.350
Hello!

06:10.090 --> 06:10.850
Soubi.

06:12.060 --> 06:12.850
Professor Ritsu...

06:14.090 --> 06:15.400
What do you want?

06:15.400 --> 06:16.180
Hey now.

06:17.670 --> 06:20.740
I heard you took care of
Professor Nagisa's Zero.

06:21.910 --> 06:24.650
I was waiting for your report.

06:26.240 --> 06:30.280
Ritsuka saw through
Zero's weakness, that's all.

06:31.160 --> 06:32.200
Ritsuka?

06:32.690 --> 06:33.380
Who?

06:33.380 --> 06:35.080
Why are you acting like that?

06:35.710 --> 06:39.190
You're the one who used your
students to try and abduct Ritsuka.

06:39.810 --> 06:41.210
What are you talking about?

06:45.650 --> 06:48.170
By the way, you sent us a strange memo...

06:49.130 --> 06:50.430
What are you trying to do?

06:55.760 --> 06:57.070
Memo?

06:57.070 --> 06:59.810
Well, I don't know...

07:00.690 --> 07:03.400
I just loaned out my students, that's all.

07:04.320 --> 07:06.840
Soubi, I'm only
interested in you...

07:06.840 --> 07:08.720
I'm busy, so I'm hanging up.

07:09.330 --> 07:10.660
Soubi? Sou...

07:17.690 --> 07:20.860
Soubi, if we don't finish this
by morning, we're in trouble!

07:21.200 --> 07:21.790
Yeah...

07:30.950 --> 07:34.240
I have to find out about Seimei...

07:35.390 --> 07:36.560
On my own.

07:53.170 --> 07:54.490
Yes! A-11.

08:03.620 --> 08:04.790
It would seem there is nothing on this floor...

08:05.020 --> 08:07.090
Come on! Why?

08:10.680 --> 08:12.500
I made it in time.

08:12.860 --> 08:14.050
This is strange...

08:24.500 --> 08:26.560
Welcome, Loveless!

08:28.280 --> 08:30.360
I've been waiting for you, Loveless.

08:30.890 --> 08:34.110
Where am I? Don't tell
me I'm inside the game?

08:34.110 --> 08:35.570
Do not worry.

08:36.280 --> 08:37.840
Who are you?

08:37.840 --> 08:38.950
Septimal Moon?

08:39.810 --> 08:41.480
The time has come.

08:41.870 --> 08:45.880
Time to decide ruin and
glory, defeat and victory.

08:46.740 --> 08:48.010
What are you talking about?

08:49.590 --> 08:51.300
Did you kill Seimei?

08:53.820 --> 08:57.760
Loveless, you must not look back
when it's time to move forward.

08:58.740 --> 09:00.790
Step forward!

09:01.400 --> 09:03.410
I want to know now!

09:03.410 --> 09:04.580
Right now!

09:06.260 --> 09:11.190
Before I disappear...

09:13.490 --> 09:14.400
Loveless?

09:16.930 --> 09:18.070
Hello?

09:32.440 --> 09:33.420
Seimei!

09:35.160 --> 09:36.170
Ritsuka...

09:37.520 --> 09:38.300
I've been waiting for you.

09:41.170 --> 09:42.460
Seimei?

09:51.880 --> 09:52.270
I...

09:52.860 --> 09:56.070
Are you okay? Ritsuka,
you don't look well.

09:56.070 --> 09:57.240
Aoyagi.

09:57.800 --> 10:03.040
You've been sleeping all
morning, are my classes that boring?

10:04.460 --> 10:07.870
I'm sorry, I...

10:08.330 --> 10:10.390
Hey, Aoyagi!

10:10.390 --> 10:11.410
Whats wrong with you?

10:22.390 --> 10:23.600
Oh, you woke up?

10:24.810 --> 10:26.230
Doctor Katsuko, I...

10:27.610 --> 10:30.380
It looks like stress and a lack
of sleep have taken a toll.

10:30.970 --> 10:32.410
I see...

10:32.410 --> 10:36.290
As soon as I sit down, I can't help it.

10:36.740 --> 10:39.430
I keep on sleeping in school...

10:40.040 --> 10:41.570
How did I get here...

10:42.980 --> 10:43.530
It's all right.

10:44.460 --> 10:45.510
Go to sleep.

11:03.730 --> 11:05.100
My head hurts...

11:07.420 --> 11:09.920
I have to go home and continue the game.

11:09.920 --> 11:12.060
I have a lot of questions to ask...

11:13.050 --> 11:15.210
Doctor Katsuko, I'm going home.

11:17.160 --> 11:17.740
Doctor.

11:27.250 --> 11:29.290
What's wrong, Doctor?

11:29.430 --> 11:30.710
Doctor Katsuko!

11:38.630 --> 11:39.720
This is not right.

11:39.850 --> 11:41.440
What's going on?

11:51.170 --> 11:51.980
Sorry...

11:53.430 --> 11:54.970
I'm sorry, Ritsuka.

11:54.970 --> 11:56.540
Mother!

11:59.320 --> 12:00.730
Don't come near me!

12:01.160 --> 12:04.550
You're not Ritsuka!

12:04.550 --> 12:05.340
Mother!

12:11.880 --> 12:14.670
Mother, I... I...

12:23.720 --> 12:24.560
Yayoi!

12:25.240 --> 12:27.020
Who did this?

12:27.020 --> 12:29.680
Hold on! I'll do something about it.

12:30.210 --> 12:32.170
D-Don't worry about me.

12:32.170 --> 12:34.280
Instead, Yuiko...

12:35.060 --> 12:35.940
Yuiko?

12:37.160 --> 12:40.310
Hurry, to school...

12:43.170 --> 12:44.240
Yayoi?

12:45.960 --> 12:47.870
Stay with me! Yayoi!

12:49.750 --> 12:50.920
Yayoi...

12:55.560 --> 12:58.160
Why has this happened?

13:12.020 --> 13:13.060
Miss Shinonome...

13:15.080 --> 13:16.730
Miss Shinonome! Miss Shinonome!

13:17.240 --> 13:18.520
Hold on, Miss Shinonome!

13:20.280 --> 13:21.910
Aoyagi?

13:22.770 --> 13:26.340
I failed as a teacher.

13:27.390 --> 13:30.530
I couldn't protect my students...

13:30.870 --> 13:32.290
Miss Shinonome...

13:32.660 --> 13:34.040
Miss Shinonome!

13:34.470 --> 13:36.000
No, Miss Shinonome!

13:45.050 --> 13:46.050
Yuiko...

14:08.040 --> 14:09.410
Yuiko! Yuiko!

14:13.000 --> 14:14.120
Ritsuka?

14:15.710 --> 14:18.130
Thank goodness, Yuiko, are you okay?

14:18.560 --> 14:19.790
What in the world happened?

14:20.800 --> 14:25.420
I'm... happy...

14:25.970 --> 14:26.920
What?

14:27.260 --> 14:33.110
I always wanted to do
something for you, Ritsuka...

14:34.060 --> 14:37.530
...so, I'm glad...

14:38.560 --> 14:41.060
I can die for you, <i>Ritsuka...</i>

14:41.680 --> 14:42.820
For me?

14:43.440 --> 14:44.610
What are you talking about?

14:44.610 --> 14:47.570
You can't, you can't die!

14:49.740 --> 14:50.530
Uh...

14:58.250 --> 14:59.440
Yuiko?

15:02.170 --> 15:04.330
You're joking, right?
Wake up!

15:05.480 --> 15:06.380
Yuiko!

15:07.250 --> 15:09.190
Yuiko, Yuiko!

15:09.640 --> 15:10.810
Yuiko!

15:10.810 --> 15:11.960
Why?

15:13.430 --> 15:14.880
Why this...

15:15.850 --> 15:16.800
Why...

15:21.280 --> 15:23.810
Somebody, help me...

15:26.070 --> 15:29.220
Help, Soubi...

15:39.960 --> 15:41.200
What's going on?

15:41.750 --> 15:42.720
Where's Yuiko?

15:48.200 --> 15:49.470
Soubi!

15:55.230 --> 15:57.700
Sorry, it's an order.

15:57.700 --> 15:59.680
Order? What do you mean?

16:00.770 --> 16:03.160
You mean...

16:03.160 --> 16:04.400
You did all this...

16:07.530 --> 16:08.480
You...

16:09.180 --> 16:10.360
You killed everybody!

16:11.240 --> 16:12.410
Let go!

16:12.410 --> 16:15.340
Ritsuka, this is a dream.

16:15.340 --> 16:16.610
Dream?

16:17.870 --> 16:19.980
Yes, a dream...

16:21.000 --> 16:25.140
If you die here, the
real Ritsuka will wake up...

16:26.090 --> 16:28.000
...just as you wished...

16:29.130 --> 16:30.370
No...

16:31.260 --> 16:35.200
I don't want to die!

16:36.230 --> 16:42.230
I finally started to like everybody.

16:43.860 --> 16:45.690
That's why I can't die yet!

16:48.370 --> 16:48.900
It's no use.

16:50.030 --> 16:51.110
Soubi!

16:52.460 --> 16:53.490
It's your destiny.

16:54.950 --> 16:56.430
Stop it, Soubi!

16:57.250 --> 16:59.570
It was decided before you were born.

17:00.080 --> 17:00.910
N-No...

17:02.080 --> 17:04.040
Just like your true name...

17:04.340 --> 17:06.100
...is Loveless.

17:07.550 --> 17:08.630
Don't...

17:11.550 --> 17:14.220
Don't call me Loveless!

17:20.610 --> 17:22.100
I am Ritsuka.

17:22.470 --> 17:24.000
Ritsuka Aoyagi!

17:24.980 --> 17:28.670
I will decide my own destiny!

17:38.490 --> 17:39.120
Ritsuka...

17:43.440 --> 17:45.080
That was a good spell.

17:47.190 --> 17:48.620
Seimei!

17:55.270 --> 17:57.030
What was that?

17:58.930 --> 17:59.640
Doctor Katsuko!

18:10.590 --> 18:14.210
Oh my. I dozed off, too...

18:14.990 --> 18:16.490
Anything wrong?

18:17.160 --> 18:17.950
No...

18:19.720 --> 18:21.410
I'm going home.

18:23.080 --> 18:24.490
See you next week.

18:29.000 --> 18:30.110
Not again!

18:30.110 --> 18:31.440
Is it broken?

18:39.350 --> 18:40.370
Mother!

18:43.210 --> 18:45.220
Yayoi, what's up?

18:46.020 --> 18:49.220
Here, the manga you wanted to borrow.

18:50.230 --> 18:53.460
You went out of your way
to bring this, thanks!

18:53.840 --> 18:55.490
Do you want to come in for a bit?

18:55.490 --> 18:57.860
Can I, Yuiko?

19:04.370 --> 19:07.370
I know! Maybe I'll
have some hot pot tonight.

19:08.040 --> 19:09.920
I'll go get some daikon radishes.

19:12.550 --> 19:13.790
Ritsuka!

19:18.590 --> 19:19.380
Thank goodness.

19:20.630 --> 19:23.240
I was worried because
I couldn't reach you.

19:25.270 --> 19:25.850
What's wrong?

19:27.230 --> 19:28.910
N-Nothing.

19:35.850 --> 19:37.150
It's a dream, Ritsuka.

19:37.560 --> 19:38.570
A dream.

19:38.570 --> 19:39.780
I know!

19:45.410 --> 19:47.120
That wasn't just a dream.

19:48.720 --> 19:49.920
Your future...

19:51.130 --> 19:52.330
Your destiny...

19:53.740 --> 19:54.870
Soubi.

19:56.430 --> 19:57.290
If...

19:58.930 --> 20:00.760
If Seimei comes back to life and...

20:02.850 --> 20:05.830
...orders you to kill me...

20:07.060 --> 20:09.520
At that moment, what would you do?

20:12.490 --> 20:14.400
Seimei is dead...

20:14.570 --> 20:16.060
I'm just saying "what if"!

20:16.060 --> 20:18.230
If you were ordered by Seimei!

20:21.490 --> 20:23.010
Answer me, Soubi!

20:23.010 --> 20:24.180
You're gonna have to kill me, aren't you?

20:26.720 --> 20:27.240
Most likely...

20:29.500 --> 20:30.450
I knew it.

20:34.500 --> 20:35.460
What?

20:36.250 --> 20:37.460
Get off me!

20:38.580 --> 20:40.010
It's not what you think, listen!

20:40.200 --> 20:42.010
I don't want to hear any excuses!

20:43.310 --> 20:45.470
If that time comes...

20:47.480 --> 20:48.680
...I'll die first.

20:49.980 --> 20:50.970
Soubi...

20:52.780 --> 20:54.520
A life without Ritsuka...

20:56.190 --> 20:57.100
I can't...

21:00.020 --> 21:01.430
What a fool.

21:02.030 --> 21:02.380
Start OP here as well

21:02.360 --> 21:12.500
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka de

21:02.360 --> 21:12.500
Under the moon’s curse, inside of a cold dream…

21:21.000 --> 21:27.390
Kotoba no nai sekai de bokura wa ai wo kataru

21:21.000 --> 21:27.390
In a world without words, we speak of love

21:22.260 --> 21:24.740
I'll look forward to seeing what happens, Ritsuka.

21:26.520 --> 21:31.580
Whether your will to live
wins, or destiny wins...

21:27.390 --> 21:31.350
itsuka kimi ni todoku made

21:27.390 --> 21:31.350
until it reaches you someday.

21:33.650 --> 21:38.000
At that moment, something much bigger
began...

21:34.180 --> 21:41.070
Kizu darake no kaina de dakiyoseta kuchibiru no

21:34.180 --> 21:41.070
I want to melt the frozen over wish...

21:41.070 --> 21:46.740
haritsumeta negai tokashitakute

21:41.070 --> 21:46.740
from the lips that I embraced with arms covered in wounds.

21:46.990 --> 21:53.700
Nee, aishiatta kako no utsukushisa sutesareba

21:46.990 --> 21:53.700
Hey, if I abandon the beauty of the past when we loved each other,

21:54.080 --> 21:59.880
ashita motto kirei na yoru e yukeru kara

21:54.080 --> 21:59.880
then tomorrow, I can go to a more beautiful night.

22:00.250 --> 22:08.430
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka kara

22:00.250 --> 22:08.430
Under the moon’s curse, from inside of a cold dream.

22:08.430 --> 22:15.100
Kimi wo tooku tsuresaritakute

22:08.430 --> 22:15.100
I want to take you somewhere far away,

22:15.100 --> 22:18.520
doko made yukeru

22:15.100 --> 22:18.520
and go anywhere,

22:18.520 --> 22:26.110
ai wo shinjite ii basho made

22:18.520 --> 22:26.110
to a place where we can believe in love.

22:35.080 --> 22:37.950
doko made yukeru

22:35.080 --> 22:37.950
...and go anywhere

22:38.380 --> 22:45.990
ai wo shinjite ii basho made

22:38.380 --> 22:45.990
to a place where we can believe in love.

22:48.910 --> 22:52.590
Yoru no mukou

22:48.910 --> 22:52.590
To the other side of night.

22:55.550 --> 22:59.390
Futari dake de

22:55.550 --> 22:59.390
Just with the two of us.
